also found this one of you

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.774
and I just have a quick
question here, Andrew.

00:00:10.774 --> 00:00:12.660
(everyone laughs)

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:13.863
Like what?

00:00:13.863 --> 00:00:15.930
I don't know that I've ever known a kid

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:17.220
that dresses-
- Oh my God.

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:18.570
- as the Pope.
- The Pope, yeah.

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:20.670
