00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:43.110
But it was like, but it's
still like hands down,

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:45.120
I'm 45, that's my best Halloween costume.

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:45.990
- Oh my God, I love you.

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:46.835
- It's the pope.

00:00:46.835 --> 00:00:47.880
- I just love that I-
- I peeked at fourth grade.

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:48.870
- Can you imagine trick or treat?

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:50.586
I've just never seen a
kid dressed as the Pope.

00:00:50.586 --> 00:00:51.419
- As the Pope.

00:00:51.419 --> 00:00:52.405
It was very, I was very popular.

00:00:52.405 --> 00:00:53.567
- [Kelly] It's usually
like Tony Stark, Iron Man.

00:00:53.567 --> 00:00:54.519
(Josh laughing)

00:00:54.519 --> 00:00:55.567
- [Andrew] It was very popular.

00:00:55.567 --> 00:00:56.719
People took a lot of pictures with me.

00:00:56.719 --> 00:00:57.840
- That's incredible.
- It was like, yeah, I felt-

00:00:57.840 --> 00:00:58.673
- [Kelly] You were a hit.

00:00:58.673 --> 00:00:59.506
- I was a hit.

00:00:59.506 --> 00:01:00.780
