to pull this one up too.

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:02.040
- [Josh] Yes, please.

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:03.150
- This was last year.

00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:03.983
- [Josh] Yeah.

00:01:03.983 --> 00:01:04.920
- And this was incredible.
- Yes.

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:06.504
- This was, this is incredible.

00:01:06.504 --> 00:01:08.036
(audience cheers)

00:01:08.036 --> 00:01:09.218
- [Josh] I mean...

00:01:09.218 --> 00:01:10.051
