- Okay.

00:01:36.244 --> 00:01:38.074
You would've let me down.

00:01:38.074 --> 00:01:38.907
(audience cheers)

00:01:38.907 --> 00:01:39.797
- Oh yeah.

00:01:39.797 --> 00:01:40.630
