I don't hang out with famous people,

00:02:04.110 --> 00:02:04.943
I'm not cool.

00:02:04.943 --> 00:02:07.710
And I, but he showed up
and he wasn't in costume.

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:10.333
And at that point I'd had a lot to drink.

00:02:10.333 --> 00:02:11.166
(Josh laughing)

00:02:11.166 --> 00:02:12.632
